Package: doctor7-api
Version: @VERSION@
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: adduser, systemd
Recommends: mariadb-client
Suggests: doctor7-web
Maintainer: doctor7-onprem maintainers <maintainers@example.org>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://example.org/doctor7-onprem
Description: doctor7-onprem API service
 Node.js API of the doctor7-onprem psychological care platform, with its
 production dependencies, a systemd unit, a daily chat purge timer, and
 per-layer backup and restore tools.
 .
 The package does not install Node.js. The service uses the binary named by
 NODE_BIN in /etc/doctor7/api.env, or /opt/node/current/bin/node, or node from
 PATH. It must be version 22 or later. The database is not installed by this
 package.
